503
00:54:50,080 --> 00:54:55,080
きみとふたりでいたんだぜ
I used to stay with you there.

504
00:55:03,488 --> 00:55:06,208
遠い、遠い、笑えない話。
Far away, far away, a tale without a smile.

505
00:55:06,208 --> 00:55:09,208
いつか、ぼくが居なくなったなら
Someday, if I were to disappear,

506
00:55:09,208 --> 00:55:11,908
深い、深い森に落ちた
I fell deep into the deep forest.

507
00:55:11,908 --> 00:55:14,738
きみは一人で行くんだぜ。
You will go on alone.

508
00:55:15,238 --> 00:55:18,108
繋いだ手には柔らかな体温
In our clasped hands, a gentle warmth.

509
00:55:18,108 --> 00:55:20,808
握った指が、ゆるり、ほどけたら。
When our intertwined fingers slowly untangled.

510
00:55:21,238 --> 00:55:23,908
枯れた音色の鐘が鳴る。
A bell with a withered tone rings.

511
00:55:23,908 --> 00:55:26,608
きみは一人で行くんだぜ。
You will go on alone.

512
00:55:27,238 --> 00:55:30,138
そのままで二人歩いて、一人
Walking together like that, then alone,

513
00:55:30,138 --> 00:55:32,638
嘘付く声も、もう絶え絶えに。
Even the lying voice is now barely hanging on.

514
00:55:33,238 --> 00:55:36,188
うつむき二人影がひとつ
Two downcast shadows become one.

515
00:55:36,188 --> 00:55:40,538
ぼくも独りで行くんだぜ？
Will I also go on alone?

516
00:55:41,138 --> 00:55:43,838
きみは淡い恋に落ちた。
You fell into a fleeting love.

517
00:55:43,838 --> 00:55:46,138
高い高い崖に咲く花。
A flower blooming on a high, high cliff.

518
00:55:46,138 --> 00:55:47,938
「届かないな。」
"I can't reach it,"

519
00:55:47,938 --> 00:55:50,538
わかっているくせに。
even though you know that.

520
00:55:51,288 --> 00:55:54,088
ぼくは深い森に落ちた
I fell deep into the forest.

521
00:55:54,088 --> 00:55:56,888
黒くすすけて汚れた果実
A fruit blackened and stained with soot.

522
00:55:56,888 --> 00:55:59,888
それで終わりそれだけの話
That's the end, that's all there is to it.

523
00:56:00,088 --> 00:56:02,888
きみは、ひとりで行くんだぜ。
You will go on alone.

524
00:56:02,888 --> 00:56:05,688
それから一人歩いて独り
Then walking alone, all by yourself,

525
00:56:05,688 --> 00:56:08,588
嘘付く事も、もう疲れた。
Tired of lying as well.

526
00:56:08,588 --> 00:56:11,288
うつむき独り黄金の部屋
Looking down alone in the golden room,

527
00:56:11,288 --> 00:56:14,688
きみとふたりでいたんだぜ
Where you and I were together.

528
00:56:24,288 --> 00:56:26,988
遠い、遠い、笑えない話。
Far away, far away, a tale without a smile.

